[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3649456960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113975#issuecomment-3649456960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113975","id":3649456960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZhktA","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T13:56:51Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T13:56:51Z","body":"This is caused by #86983 (introduced in 4.5.beta1), as it changed only `get_id_path` to return an empty path if the first point is disabled (which is the case in the MRP).\n\nIn case the first point is disabled:\n- `get_id_path` returning an empty array is correct/intended.\n- `get_point_path` not returning an empty array is a bug. This needs to be fixed, I'll open a PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3649456960/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3649558106","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113975#issuecomment-3649558106","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113975","id":3649558106,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Zh9Za","user":{"login":"AidasLit","id":129107308,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7IFbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129107308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit","html_url":"https://github.com/AidasLit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T15:50:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T15:50:04Z","body":"I thought get_id_path was the problem, turns out it's the opposite. \n\nI checked the parts where I disable nodes, and there was a problem with my own code. I was getting the path before setting the first node back to enabled, I just never realised that as the navigation worked with no issues a year ago on 4.3, when I first wrote that code.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3649558106/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3685803732","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113975#issuecomment-3685803732","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113975","id":3685803732,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bsObU","user":{"login":"MohammedTaherMcW","id":155310716,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUHafA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155310716?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW","html_url":"https://github.com/MohammedTaherMcW","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohammedTaherMcW/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T08:59:15Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T08:59:15Z","body":"@AidasLit, I was looking into this issue, Could you please share a video clip or screenshot of the problem for reference?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3685803732/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3686076294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113975#issuecomment-3686076294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113975","id":3686076294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7btQ-G","user":{"login":"AidasLit","id":129107308,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7IFbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129107308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit","html_url":"https://github.com/AidasLit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T10:20:22Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T10:20:22Z","body":"@MohammedTaherMcW Here's a quick code snippet that showcases the problem:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar astar : AStar2D = AStar2D.new()\n\t\n\tastar.add_point(0, Vector2.ZERO)\n\tastar.add_point(1, Vector2.ONE)\n\tastar.add_point(2, Vector2(2, 2))\n\t\n\tastar.connect_points(0, 1)\n\tastar.connect_points(1, 2)\n\t\n\tastar.set_point_disabled(0, true)\n\tastar.set_point_disabled(1, false)\n\tastar.set_point_disabled(2, false)\n\t\n\tprint(astar.get_id_path(0, 2))\n\tprint(astar.get_point_path(0, 2))\n\n```\n\nThe printed result is this:\n<img width=\"322\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/978fd83c-80a5-4441-bcf4-eff46e2f99f7\" />\n\nBoth methods should be returning an empty path, as the first node is disabled, but get_point_path() still returns a path.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3686076294/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]